            <div xml:id="m-42e379f5-efc1-4a3a-b8b1-0bb5674eea13">
              <lg xml:id="m-b85db503-eb3c-4e23-8b4b-424d169c3884">
                <l xml:id="m-f81b40bb-8271-4dd2-aff0-f345f1056a70" facs="#m-6565f375-0745-40c5-962f-4ba5db5abb98" label="ambiguous">78</l><l xml:id="m-96d92983-8a0e-4bbc-86d2-966a3fdfe2ab" facs="#m-c845282b-4f07-45d6-8cbf-ff9178b76363" label="ambiguous">Credo. — VI.</l><l xml:id="m-d0c28bf5-9ea1-4375-bdc8-bca15bd71c10" facs="#m-c60b9834-b9dc-4f1d-bb61-1c5b3b9ef369" label="lyrics-like">ú-num baptísma</l><l xml:id="m-7935eb46-3d7c-4e3a-a338-b89a9e07d430" facs="#m-2e75a5bd-e8a7-419d-a23f-c9e997c6c50c" label="ambiguous">Et</l><l xml:id="m-d6debd43-69cb-4c94-b490-18386762b11c" facs="#m-d1632f8f-5bc8-4e7e-afd7-ad2eaae81371" label="ambiguous">in remissi-o-nem</l><l xml:id="m-89a63cd5-369e-441e-9778-b8d3d722861d" facs="#m-eea8fb69-ea38-4fac-87ba-ec830e286f3d" label="lyrics-like">pecca-tó- rum.</l><l xml:id="m-fb9e2d5f-9b71-4b63-a44c-51fe2c788341" facs="#m-950f65f3-34ad-4380-ae4d-811ddee0150e" label="lyrics-like">Et ví-tam</l><l xml:id="m-ffe85a31-da09-4de1-a05f-0b877f9e1932" facs="#m-a9a82d03-41f3-4cda-9a47-4132c89b56a4" label="lyrics-like">exspécto</l><l xml:id="m-7ef537fa-4c0d-42b1-bbcf-aa80ca705fda" facs="#m-735fe4d4-1a15-4ee0-8ad9-e47441bb2222" label="lyrics-like">resurrecti-ó-nem mortu-6¬rum.</l><l xml:id="m-fd326d02-c193-45da-b60f-c36443b1a540" facs="#m-677608a7-6ec2-41bc-b008-a57c64c8ac97" label="ambiguous">- - - men</l><l xml:id="m-8dad9471-be97-48ee-98f9-39dc36a70932" facs="#m-f18a613e-3ba4-4226-8b2b-4951c3f37458" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-d9ec0c7a-a714-40c1-9d63-001b28edecb4" facs="#m-2c0ffcaf-da71-4366-a31d-1627bd3d8001" label="lyrics-like">ventú-ri saécu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-72042388-3e51-4223-9540-b2978b9b5a24" facs="#m-fded9afb-425a-469e-9b87-621bcdbd05f9" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-93f7b68c-018d-4865-adf4-0a279c81770c" facs="#m-67ade3bc-ea96-44f6-b6cb-5bbcda57a6f3" label="text-like">This Ordinary is NOT meant to be a matter of hard and fast rule:</l><l xml:id="m-9676fac0-964f-4621-978b-e6254c61e306" facs="#m-71ba4c67-1f24-4a93-876c-8ada278382f8" label="text-like">chants from one Mass may be used together with those from others, the</l><l xml:id="m-d5108619-4f20-4a60-b4e7-0be32211ac17" facs="#m-3722eb9b-1ffe-4edf-b456-f34e0db74374" label="text-like">Ferial Masses excepted. In the same way, in order to add greater solemnity.</l><l xml:id="m-40d24917-0a2c-4e77-b42e-81274a0bc535" facs="#m-b788e263-9d97-4977-b42e-7b7d63c3c9fc" label="text-like">one or more of the following</l><l xml:id="m-a55e368b-6a09-4053-b04c-a918f6363354" facs="#m-b814e21b-54e5-4fe0-88b5-b473c116704b" label="text-like">Chants ad libitum" may be employed.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>